# fixtures/lq/cases/strict-gql.cases: the strict-GQL spelling mode ([LQ/grammar-v1.ebnf §G], [LQ/gql-spelling §3])
# (WP-22, R-FIX). Every case runs with '%% mode strict-gql'. Each refused Cypher spelling of §G.2 is E004 in this
# mode; every GQL spelling and every construct of §G.3 stays accepted, with the same S-AST as in the default mode
# ([LQ/grammar-v1.ebnf §G.1]). The same inputs parse in the default mode (conformance.cases, parser.cases).
# Positions of the E004 refusals are 'conv': the first token of the refused spelling (INDEX.md §4 G-7).
# Format: fixtures/lq/INDEX.md §2.

%% case sg-quant-range
%% source [LQ/grammar-v1.ebnf §G.2]
%% source [LQ/gql-spelling §2.1]
%% entry read
%% mode strict-gql
%% input
MATCH (a)-[:BLOCKS*1..3]->(b) RETURN a
%% error E004 1:19 conv
%% end

